Dear Quality Team,

During warehouse inspection at our Sao Paulo facility, we observed hard caking
and lump formation in 6 of 20 fiber drums of Metformin Hydrochloride API
(Granulated, assay specification 95-105%) received under batch MTF-251108,
manufactured on 8 November 2025 with a retest date of 7 November 2027.

Approximately 150 kg of the 500 kg supplied quantity is affected. The drums
were stored in our climate-controlled warehouse at 25C and below 60% RH. Two
drums remain sealed and unopened.

The material is required for a production campaign scheduled for next week;
please advise urgently whether to hold the entire batch. No finished product
has been manufactured from the affected drums.

